---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Ember & Ink is a warm, literary book blog for self-help and fantasy romance readers â€” honest reviews, thoughtful essays, and curated reading lists."
  url={`${SITE.url}/about/`}
>
  <article class="container-ember py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl">
    <header>
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl text-burgundy">
        A quiet corner for readers who read slowly.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted">
        Ember &amp; Ink is a book blog for people who like to sit with a
        book. We write honest reviews, thoughtful essays, and carefully
        curated reading lists â€” with a soft spot for self-help that
        actually helps, and fantasy romance that actually sweeps you off
        your feet.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-ember mt-10">
<p>Welcome to Ember &amp; Ink! I’m currently surviving 11th grade, but when I’m not buried in schoolwork, I’m usually buried in a book. I have a deep love for poetry—those small, powerful words that capture big feelings—and an endless appetite for stories. To me, reading is the ultimate escape. Whether I’m getting lost in the sweeping, slow-burn romance of a fantasy world or finding practical, grounding wisdom in a self-help book, I believe the right book always finds you when you need it.</p>
<p>I started Ember &amp; Ink as a cozy corner of the internet to share honest thoughts, curated reading lists, and the books that stay with me long after the last page. Because balancing high school and a book blog is a lot, I do use modern AI tools to help me draft and format some of my longer reviews (a student has to survive, right?). But rest assured, every book featured here is chosen with intention, and every word is polished with care.</p>
<p>Whether you are here for a new romantasy obsession, a poem to soothe your soul, or a guide to building better habits, I’m so glad you’re here. Grab a cup of tea, find a quiet corner, and let’s talk books.</p>
</div>

    <div class="mt-14 rounded-card bg-paper border border-line p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl">Ember &amp; Ink in short</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
        Warm reviews, honest opinions, and reading lists for self-help and
        fantasy romance readers. No hype. No spoilers without warning.
        No paid positive reviews. Just a person, a mug of tea, and a
        steadily growing stack of books.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/blog/"
          class="rounded-pill bg-burgundy text-paper px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-burgundy-dark transition-colors"
        >
          Read the blog
        </a>
        <a
          href="/faq/"
          class="rounded-pill bg-gold-soft text-burgundy px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gold/40 transition-colors"
        >
          Read the FAQ
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="rounded-pill border border-line px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium hover:border-gold transition-colors"
        >
          Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
